$is_nonempty_set(fn(k R) R {0})

witness exist k R st {k>0} from 2

fn_range(fn(k R: k>0) R {0})={0}

$is_nonempty_set(fn(k R: k>0) R {0})

have Carrier set={}

have abstract_empty fn(k Carrier) R

